  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - On 28/05/2025, the use of 17 Bulstrode Avenue, TW3 3AA as a Sui Generis Annexe to the guesthouse accommodation at Crompton Guest House, 49 Lampton Road TW3 1JG was lawful within the meaning of Section 191(2) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\nThe evidence supplied is sufficient to establish that on the balance of probabilities the property at '17 Bulstrode Avenue, TW3 3AA' has been used as a Sui Generis annexe to the guesthouse accommodation at Crompton Guest House, 49 Lampton Road TW3 1JG for a continuous period of at least ten years from the date of application, and would therefore be lawful under Section 171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended). \r\n"
